@startuml Agentforce Chatbot Integration
title Agentforce Chatbot with Subagents

actor Customer
participant Chatbot as "Agentforce Chatbot"
participant SubAgent as "Specialized Subagent"
participant Controller as "Apex Controller"
participant Service as "Business Service"
participant Database as "Salesforce DB"
participant HumanAgent as "Human Support Agent"

== Initial Customer Interaction ==
Customer -> Chatbot: "Help me find combo packages"
Chatbot -> Chatbot: Process natural language
note right: Agentforce uses your system prompt + conversation context

== Combo Package Assistance ==
Chatbot -> Controller: getAllPackages() via Apex action
Controller -> Database: SELECT FROM ComboPackage__c WITH SECURITY_ENFORCED
Database --> Controller: Package data
Controller --> Chatbot: PackageWrapper[]

Chatbot -> Customer: "I found these packages: Computing Bundle ($500), Connectivity Pack ($300)..."

Customer -> Chatbot: "Tell me more about the Computing Bundle"
Chatbot -> Controller: getPackageDetails(packageId)
Controller --> Chatbot: Detailed package info
Chatbot -> Customer: Package breakdown + pricing + recommendations

== Subagent Delegation for Complex Tasks ==
Customer -> Chatbot: "I need a custom quote for 50 units"
Chatbot -> Chatbot: Evaluate complexity
note right: Agentforce determines if subagent needed

Chatbot -> SubAgent: Delegate quote generation
note right: Subagent: "QuoteGenerationSubagent"

SubAgent -> Service: generateQuote(requestData)
Service -> Database: INSERT TALEXO_Quote__c + NexusQuoteLineItem__c
Database --> Service: Quote created

Service -> SubAgent: QuoteResponse
SubAgent -> Chatbot: Formatted quote summary
Chatbot -> Customer: "I've created a quote for you. Total: $12,500 with 10% discount..."

== AI-Powered Recommendations ==
Customer -> Chatbot: "What should I buy?"
Chatbot -> Controller: getProductRecommendations(userId)
Controller -> Service: analyzeUserBehavior()
Service -> Database: SELECT OrderHistory__c, preferences
Database --> Service: User data

Service -> Chatbot: AI recommendations
Chatbot -> Customer: "Based on your computing needs, I'd recommend our AI Bundle..."

== Handover to Human Agent ==
Customer -> Chatbot: "This is too complex, I need to speak to someone"
Chatbot -> Chatbot: Assess handover criteria
note right: Criteria: quote value >$10K, custom requirements, customer frustration

Chatbot -> HumanAgent: Create support case + context
note right: Transfers: conversation history, customer data, current context

HumanAgent -> Customer: Live chat takeover
note right: Seamless transition with full context

== Post-Interaction Follow-up ==
Chatbot -> Database: Log conversation + outcomes
Database --> Chatbot: Logged

alt Successful interaction
    Chatbot -> Customer: "Is there anything else I can help you with?"
else Needs follow-up
    Chatbot -> Customer: "I'll have a specialist contact you within 24 hours"
    Chatbot -> HumanAgent: Schedule follow-up
end

== Subagent Capabilities ==
note over SubAgent
    **Available Subagents:**
    - QuoteGenerationSubagent
    - ComboPackageSubagent
    - OrderSupportSubagent
    - ProductRecommendationSubagent
    - AccountManagementSubagent

    **Subagent Benefits:**
    - Specialized expertise
    - Complex task handling
    - Fallback for chatbot limits
    - Maintains conversation flow
end note

== Integration Points ==
note over Controller, Service
    **Chatbot Integrates With:**
    - ComboPackageController
    - QuoteGenerationService
    - ProductController
    - OrderService
    - AccountController

    **Data Access:**
    - Real-time inventory
    - Live pricing
    - Customer history
    - AI recommendations
end note
@enduml